#: src/architecture/overview.md:1
msgid "Vue d'ensemble Technique & AIP"
msgstr ""

#: src/architecture/overview.md:3
msgid ""
"_Stack, workspace Rust, interactions entre briques, et spécification "
"complète de l'Agent Interface Protocol._"
msgstr ""

#: src/architecture/overview.md:5
msgid ""
"**Prérequis de lecture :** cette page assume une familiarité avec Python "
"async/await. Aucune connaissance de Rust n'est requise — les concepts Rust "
"sont expliqués quand ils apparaissent. Si un terme n'est pas clair, "
"consultez le [Glossaire](./glossary)."
msgstr ""

#: src/architecture/overview.md:7
msgid "**Concepts clés :**"
msgstr ""

#: src/architecture/overview.md:8
msgid ""
"**AIP** (Agent Interface Protocol) : le contrat minimal entre un agent "
"Python et le runtime Rust. Deux fonctions suffisent : `manifest()` (qui je "
"suis) et `run(task, ctx)` (que je fais)."
msgstr ""

#: src/architecture/overview.md:9
msgid ""
"**ORIA** : le moteur d'exécution qui supervise les agents — Observer, "
"Reasoner, Actor. Il applique les garde-fous (StepBudget) et peut planifier "
"automatiquement en mode orchestré."
msgstr ""

#: src/architecture/overview.md:10
msgid ""
"**Acteur Tokio** : un composant autonome qui possède son état et communique "
"par messages. C'est le pattern de concurrence utilisé par le runtime "
"(inspiré d'[Alice Ryhl](https://ryhl.io/blog/actors-with-tokio/))."
msgstr ""

#: src/architecture/overview.md:12
msgid "Diagramme simplifié"
msgstr ""

#: src/architecture/overview.md:14
msgid ""
"```mermaid\n"
"graph TB\n"
"    subgraph Desktop[\"Apollia Desktop (Tauri + Svelte)\"]\n"
"        UI[WebView UI]\n"
"    end\n"
"\n"
"    subgraph Runtime[\"Apollia OS Runtime (Rust)\"]\n"
"        API[API Server :7771]\n"
"        SUP[Supervisor]\n"
"        EB[EventBus]\n"
"        AR[AgentRegistry]\n"
"        TR[TaskRouter]\n"
"\n"
"        subgraph Execution[\"Par agent actif\"]\n"
"            EC[ExecutionCoordinator]\n"
"            ORIA[ORIA Engine]\n"
"            SB[StepBudget]\n"
"            RL[ResilienceLayer]\n"
"        end\n"
"\n"
"        TOOLS[Tool Registry]\n"
"        MEM[Memory Engine SQLite]\n"
"        LLM[LLM Router]\n"
"        TRIG[TriggerEngine]\n"
"        PIPE[PipelineEngine]\n"
"    end\n"
"\n"
"    subgraph Agents[\"Agents Python\"]\n"
"        A1[\"Agent 1 (manifest + run)\"]\n"
"        A2[\"Agent 2 (LangGraph)\"]\n"
"    end\n"
"\n"
"    UI --> API\n"
"    API --> TR\n"
"    TR --> EC\n"
"    EC --> ORIA\n"
"    ORIA --> A1\n"
"    ORIA --> A2\n"
"    ORIA --> TOOLS\n"
"    ORIA --> LLM\n"
"    A1 -.->|ctx.tools| TOOLS\n"
