#: src/components/oria-engine.md:364
msgid "5. HITL — Human-in-the-Loop (Sprint 11)"
msgstr ""

#: src/components/oria-engine.md:366
msgid ""
"Le HITL permet à un agent de **suspendre son exécution** pour demander une "
"décision humaine avant de continuer. ORIA implémente deux variantes selon le "
"mode d'exécution."
msgstr ""

#: src/components/oria-engine.md:368
msgid ""
"5.1 Mode Direct — Suspension sur `AIPResult.input_required()`  (STORY-096)"
msgstr ""

#: src/components/oria-engine.md:370
msgid ""
"En Mode Direct, l'agent Python initie la suspension en retournant "
"`AIPResult.input_required(prompt, context)` depuis `run()`. ORIA prend alors "
"le relais :"
msgstr ""

#: src/components/oria-engine.md:372
msgid ""
"```\n"
"agent.run(task, ctx)\n"
"  └── AIPResult.input_required(prompt=\"Confirmer le montant 5 100 €\", "
"context={...})\n"
"\n"
"ORIA.execute_direct() :\n"
"  ├── 1. Persiste prompt + context → TaskRepository.save_input_required() "
"(SQLite)\n"
"  ├── 2. Émet RuntimeEvent::TaskInputRequired { task_id, prompt, step_id: "
"None }\n"
"  ├── 3. PendingApprovals.register(task_id) → "
"oneshot::Receiver<InputResponseData>\n"
"  ├── 4. await rx  ← SUSPENSION PURE (StepBudget ne progresse pas)\n"
"  │         │\n"
"  │         └── ResumeHandler.resolve(task_id, approved=true/false, "
"reason?)\n"
"  │                  └── oneshot::Sender<InputResponseData>.send(response)\n"
"  │\n"
"  ├── Si approved=true :\n"
"  │   ├── Reconstruit AIPTask avec is_resumed=True + input_response peuplé\n"
"  │   └── Rappelle agent.run(resumed_task, ctx) → résultat final\n"
"  │\n"
"  └── Si approved=false :\n"
"      └── AIPResult::failed(\"REJECTED\", reason) — run() n'est PAS rappelé\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

