msgid "Thread OS dedie pour `cpal::Stream`"
msgstr ""

#: src/components/stt.md:554
msgid ""
"Core Audio sur macOS impose une affinite de thread — `cpal::Stream` n'est "
"pas `Send`. Le buffer partage `Arc<Mutex<Vec<f32>>>` permet la communication "
"cross-thread."
msgstr ""

#: src/components/stt.md:555
msgid "Resample rubato sinc"
msgstr ""

#: src/components/stt.md:555
msgid ""
"Qualite superieure aux algorithmes lineaires pour la conversion 48 kHz → 16 "
"kHz. Le surcout CPU est negligeable face a l'inference."
msgstr ""

