msgstr ""

#: src/api/http-reference.md:255
msgid "**Événements Mode Direct :**"
msgstr ""

#: src/api/http-reference.md:256
msgid ""
"```\n"
"data: "
"{\"event\":\"started\",\"task_id\":\"t-abc123\",\"agent_id\":\"agent-def456\"}\n"
"\n"
"data: "
"{\"event\":\"completed\",\"task_id\":\"t-abc123\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"output\":\"...\"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: src/api/http-reference.md:262
msgid "**Événements Mode Orchestré (Sprint 10) :**"
msgstr ""

#: src/api/http-reference.md:263
msgid ""
"```\n"
"data: "
"{\"event\":\"plan_generated\",\"task_id\":\"t-abc123\",\"plan_id\":\"p-001\",\"step_count\":3,\n"
"       \"steps\":[{\"step_id\":\"s1\",\"description\":\"Lire le "
"fichier\",\"tool_hint\":\"file_io\",\"depends_on\":[]},\n"
"                "
"{\"step_id\":\"s2\",\"description\":\"Analyser\",\"tool_hint\":null,\"depends_on\":[\"s1\"]}]}\n"
"\n"
"data: "
"{\"event\":\"step_started\",\"task_id\":\"t-abc123\",\"plan_id\":\"p-001\",\n"
"       \"step_id\":\"s1\",\"num\":1,\"total\":3,\"desc\":\"Lire le "
"fichier\"}\n"
"\n"
"data: "
"{\"event\":\"step_completed\",\"task_id\":\"t-abc123\",\"plan_id\":\"p-001\",\n"
"       \"step_id\":\"s1\",\"duration_ms\":120}\n"
"\n"
"data: "
"{\"event\":\"step_failed\",\"task_id\":\"t-abc123\",\"plan_id\":\"p-001\",\n"
"       \"step_id\":\"s2\",\"error\":\"file not found\",\"retryable\":true}\n"
"\n"
"data: "
"{\"event\":\"plan_replanning\",\"task_id\":\"t-abc123\",\"plan_id\":\"p-001\",\n"
"       \"attempt\":1,\"failed_step\":\"s2\",\"reason\":\"file not found\"}\n"
"\n"
"data: "
"{\"event\":\"plan_completed\",\"task_id\":\"t-abc123\",\"plan_id\":\"p-001\",\n"
"       \"step_count\":3,\"duration_ms\":4100}\n"
"\n"
"data: "
"{\"event\":\"plan_failed\",\"task_id\":\"t-abc123\",\"plan_id\":\"p-001\",\n"
"       \"reason\":\"MAX_REPLAN_EXCEEDED\"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: src/api/http-reference.md:287
msgid "**Événements HITL _(Sprint 11)_ :**"
msgstr ""

#: src/api/http-reference.md:288
msgid ""
"```\n"
"data: "
"{\"event\":\"input_required\",\"task_id\":\"t-abc123\",\"prompt\":\"Confirmer "
"l'envoi ?\",\"step_id\":null}\n"
"\n"
"data: "
"{\"event\":\"task_resumed\",\"task_id\":\"t-abc123\",\"approved\":true}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: src/api/http-reference.md:294
msgid ""
"`input_required` n'est **pas** un événement terminal — la tâche reste "
"suspendue et attend une décision via `POST /api/v1/tasks/:id/resume`. Le "
"flux reste ouvert. `task_resumed` est émis dès que la reprise est "
"enregistrée ; la tâche repasse en `working`."
msgstr ""

#: src/api/http-reference.md:296
msgid ""
"**Événements terminaux :** `completed`, `failed`, `canceled`, `plan_failed`. "
"Le flux se ferme après réception d'un événement terminal. `input_required` "
"et `task_resumed` ne ferment pas le flux."
msgstr ""

