msgid "**HITL**"
msgstr ""

#: src/decisions/adr-034-chat-hybride-sessions-streaming-hitl-inline.md:40
msgid ""
"Tous les outils requièrent approbation HITL par défaut en mode chat ; 3 "
"boutons : Accept / Refuse / Always Accept (whitelist per-session)"
msgstr ""

#: src/decisions/adr-034-chat-hybride-sessions-streaming-hitl-inline.md:41
msgid "**Persistance**"
msgstr ""

#: src/decisions/adr-034-chat-hybride-sessions-streaming-hitl-inline.md:41
msgid "`chat.db` SQLite séparé (sessions, messages, autorisations outils)"
msgstr ""

#: src/decisions/adr-034-chat-hybride-sessions-streaming-hitl-inline.md:42
msgid "**Mémoire**"
msgstr ""

#: src/decisions/adr-034-chat-hybride-sessions-streaming-hitl-inline.md:42
msgid ""
"Historique persistant dans `chat.db` ; alimentation mémoire épisodique à "
"l'initiative de l'agent (Principe #6)"
msgstr ""

#: src/decisions/adr-034-chat-hybride-sessions-streaming-hitl-inline.md:46
msgid ""
"Pour le Chat Libre, le runtime embarque un agent Rust natif "
"(`BuiltInChatAgent`) qui implémente une boucle ReAct sans Python :"
msgstr ""

#: src/decisions/adr-034-chat-hybride-sessions-streaming-hitl-inline.md:48
msgid ""
"```\n"
"User message\n"
"  → CompletionRequest (system_prompt + history + tool_specs)\n"
"  → LlmRouter.stream(request)\n"
"  → Parse response :\n"
"      Texte → émettre ChatToken par token → sauver → fin\n"
"      Tool call → vérifier autorisation session :\n"
"          Autorisé → exécuter → feed result → boucle\n"
"          Non autorisé → ChatApprovalRequired → await décision\n"
"            Accept → exécuter → boucle\n"
"            AlwaysAccept → whitelist + exécuter → boucle\n"
"            Refuse → \"outil refusé\" → boucle\n"
"  → StepBudget guard (max iterations par échange)\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

